  "question": {
    "text": "If sample A contains 100 observations $101,102, \\ldots$ 200 and sample B contains 100 obsections $151,152,$ \\ldots 250, then ratio of variance $\\mathrm{v}_{\\mathrm{A}} / \\mathrm{v}_{\\mathrm{B}}=$",
